# Web auxiliary features

Band A/B/C template for browser-delivered products (SPA, MPA, SSR, PWA, admin consoles).
Copy to `.devcentr/checklists/auxiliary-web.cmk`.
Progress: `auxiliary-web.cmk.checks/state.json5` (do not rewrite markers here for checkoff).

Mark N/A in the sidecar with marker `-` and a note (e.g. marketing site — no accounts).
Stable ids: trailing `{id="…"}`.

## Band A — 1.0 blockers

::: checklist [type="progress" id="web-a"]
[ ] Build/version visible + API /version (or equivalent) {id="web.a.build-version"}
[ ] Help/docs entry {id="web.a.help"}
[ ] Error boundary + copy diagnostics {id="web.a.error-boundary"}
[ ] Auth session expiry UX (if any) {id="web.a.auth-session"}
[ ] Privacy/cookie consent as required {id="web.a.privacy-consent"}
[ ] Status/incident link (multi-user SaaS) {id="web.a.status-link"}
[ ] Connectivity honesty {id="web.a.connectivity"}
[ ] Deploy/rollback pipeline {id="web.a.deploy-rollback"}
[ ] CSP/security headers baseline {id="web.a.csp"}
[ ] PWA reload prompt (if service worker) {id="web.a.pwa-reload"}
:::

## Band B — support and retention

::: checklist [type="progress" id="web-b"]
[ ] What's new {id="web.b.whats-new"}
[ ] Account settings (+ deletion if required) {id="web.b.account-settings"}
[ ] Support contact with build id {id="web.b.support"}
[ ] Feature-flag dump {id="web.b.feature-flags"}
[ ] Client debug dump (redacted) {id="web.b.debug-dump"}
[ ] Accessibility baseline {id="web.b.a11y"}
[ ] Performance budgets on critical routes {id="web.b.perf-budgets"}
:::

## Band C — fleets and scale

::: checklist [type="progress" id="web-c"]
[ ] Localization / RTL if claimed {id="web.c.l10n"}
[ ] Admin/audit extras as product requires {id="web.c.admin-audit"}
:::
